  "details": "This doesn't happen a lot, but it happens enough to be an annoyance. I sleep in VR, and at times I open a new instance to sleep in, but before my alarm time in the morning the instance gets closed for being too old (example from this morning attached). \n\nThis issue has occurred through various versions of the client going back several months, and I believe is likely to be a server-side issue rather than with the client.\n\nAn instance should be able to be opened for at least 12 hours minimum before being determined to be old, possibly 24 hours at least. Please look into and fix this problem as it is extremely annoying to be woken up early by the instance being closed, also losing the good morning messages left to me by friends during the night.",
